## 2. C# Compiler Constraints (`csc.exe` v4.0.30319 — STRICT C# 5.0 ONLY)

The standalone binaries (`Isora-Sentinel-Setup.exe` and `Isora-Sentinel-Tray.exe`) are compiled directly on Windows using the built-in .NET Framework 4.8 compiler:
`C:\Windows\Microsoft.NET\Framework64\v4.0.30319\csc.exe`

**`csc.exe` v4.0.30319 ONLY supports C# 5.0.** If you use ANY C# 6.0+ syntax, compilation will fail immediately with `CS1056`, `CS1525`, or `CS0103`.

| Feature | FORBIDDEN (C# 6+ — Breaks Build) | REQUIRED (C# 5.0 Compatible) |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| String Interpolation | `$"Hola {name}"` | `string.Format("Hola {0}", name)` or `"Hola " + name` |
| Null-Conditional | `obj?.Prop` / `arr?[0]` | `if (obj != null) ...` |
| `nameof` Operator | `nameof(MyParam)` | `"MyParam"` |
| Inline `out` Variables | `int.TryParse(s, out int val)` | `int val; int.TryParse(s, out val);` |
| Expression-Bodied Members | `public int X => 5;` | `public int X { get { return 5; } }` |
| Auto-Property Initializers | `public int X { get; set; } = 1;` | Initialize inside constructor or backing field |
| `using static` | `using static System.Math;` | `Math.Max(...)` |
| ValueTuples | `(int a, string b)` | `Tuple<int, string>` or custom `class`/`struct` |

---

## 3. Modular C# Architecture (`installer/src/`)

All shared business logic, security validation, UAC handling, and process execution live in **`installer/src/SentinelCore.cs`** (`namespace IsoraSentinel.Core`). Never duplicate logic across UI forms.

### 3.1. `installer/src/SentinelCore.cs` (Core Layer — Single Source of Truth)
1. **`SentinelCatalog` & `SentinelModuleDefinition`:**
   - Centralizes all 7 execution engines (`Cleanup_Screenshots`, `Cleanup_Temp_Global`, `Defender_Scan`, `Integrity_Check`, `BitLocker_Audit`, `Event_Audit`, `Archive_Downloads`).
   - **To add a new engine:** Add a single `SentinelModuleDefinition` entry to `SentinelCatalog.AllModules`. Both `SentinelTray.cs` and `TaskConfigForm.cs` dynamically read `SentinelCatalog.AllModules`.
2. **`SentinelPaths`:**
   - Resolves `InstallDir`, `LogsDir`, `EnginesDir`, and `ResolveActiveDesktopUserProfileDir()` (resolves the real interactive desktop user's `C:\Users\<user>` via `Explorer.exe` process owner or `HKLM\...\Authentication\LogonUI\LastLoggedOnUser` when UAC elevates as a different Administrator account).
3. **`SentinelSecurity`:**
   - `IsValidSafeEngineName(string)`: Strict whitelist (`^[a-zA-Z0-9_\-]+$`) preventing command injection from tampered `.progress.json` files.
   - `EscapePowerShellSingleQuoted(string)`: Doubles single quotes (`'` -> `''`) and strips `\r`/`\n`/`\0`.
   - `SanitizeDirectoryPath(string)`: Strips dangerous shell metacharacters (`"`, `;`, `|`, `&`, `` ` ``, `$`).
   - `HardenInstallationDirectoryAcl(string)` & `EnsureSharedStatusDirectory()`: Native `.NET` `DirectorySecurity` ACLs using `WellKnownSidType` (works in Spanish, English, French, or German Windows without localized group name failures).
4. **`SafeProcessRunner`:**
   - Executes PowerShell exclusively via `-EncodedCommand` (Base64 UTF-16LE) so inner quotes in paths or `schtasks.exe` never break.
   - `ReadProcessOutputSmartEncoding`: Detects UTF-16LE BOM, UTF-8 BOM, null-byte ratio, UTF-8 without BOM, and OEM CodePage fallback so `schtasks.exe /Query /XML` never corrupts Spanish accents (`Día`, `Miércoles`, `Análisis`).
5. **`TaskSchedulerBridge`:**
   - `BuildHardenTaskSettingsPowerShell`: Applies Windows 11 Modern Standby (S0) battery settings (`-AllowStartIfOnBatteries -DontStopIfGoingOnBatteries -StartWhenAvailable`).
   - `BuildSafeCancelPowerShellScript`: Deterministic 4-step cancellation order:
     1. Stop Scheduled Task (`Stop-ScheduledTask` / `schtasks /End`) AND kill parent `powershell.exe` (`taskkill /F /PID ... /T`) **FIRST** so the script cannot advance to its next step or rewrite `.progress.json`.
     2. Delete all `*.progress.json` files **SECOND**.
     3. Stop native Windows engines (`Stop-MpScan`, `MpCmdRun.exe -Scan -Cancel`, `taskkill /F /IM MpCmdRun.exe /IM dism.exe /T`) **THIRD**.
6. **`CrossAccountEnvironment`:**
   - Enumerates `C:\ProgramData\Isora-Sentinel\status` and all `C:\Users\*\AppData\Local\Isora-Sentinel\status` folders so standard users, elevated admins, and `NT AUTHORITY\SYSTEM` share live task progress seamlessly.
   - `GetBestLogsDirectory` scans `*.log` with `SearchOption.AllDirectories` inside `logs\ISO_*\`.
7. **`GdiHelper`:**
   - Caches `Font` instances and wraps `CreateRoundRectRgn` + `DeleteObject` (`gdi32.dll`) to prevent Windows 11's 10,000 GDI handle limit crash.

### 3.2. Presentation Layer (`installer/src/`)
* `SentinelTray.cs`: System tray icon, context menu, SHA-256 `IntegrityVerifier`, live `.progress.json` polling (`750ms`), and UAC dispatch.
* `TaskConfigForm.cs`: Executive configuration GUI (`--config`), animated 60fps `ToggleSwitch`, custom GDI+ progress bar, and `schtasks.exe /Query /XML` reader.
* `SentinelSetup.cs`: 4-step standalone installer wizard, pre-existing task cleanup (`DisableExistingScheduledTask`), and CLI switches (`--audit`, `--extract`, `--version`, `--help`, `--uninstall`).
* `UninstallForm.cs`: 3-step uninstaller wizard.
* `Localization.cs`: Bilingual `ES / EN` dictionary (`Loc.T(es, en)`).

