## 5. Mandatory Build & Test Verification Gate

Before finishing ANY task that modifies `.ps1` or `.cs` files, you MUST run:

```powershell
# 1. Run all 41 Pester unit, engine, logger, and AST syntax tests (must be 41 Passed, 0 Failed):
powershell.exe -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\tests\Invoke-Tests.ps1

# 2. Rebuild integrity.manifest.json, compile C# binaries with csc.exe, and sign with Authenticode:
powershell.exe -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\installer\Build-InstallerExe.ps1
```
